<h1>Modify (Dimension)</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">T</span><span lang="EN-US">he</span> <span lang="EN-US" class="Command">Modify (Dimension)</span> <span lang="EN-US">command is accessible from the</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>context menu for dimensions</b></span> <b><i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>&gt; Modify</b></span></i></b><span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">This command formats individual dimension. When you call it the following dialog appears:</span></p>
<p class="bullet"><img src="../images/modify_dimension.gif" width="411px" height="339px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle">Measurement alignment group:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB">1D</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">- select one of the options (X, Y, or Z) to make the dimension 1D along Ox, Oy, or Oz axis. If</span> <span lang="EN-GB">Axis prefix</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">option in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>System &gt; Preferences &gt; Display &gt; Dimensioning</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">dialog is enabled then X, Y, or Z appear in front of the value.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>2D</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">- select one of the options (XY, YZ, or ZX) to make the dimension 2D on OXY, OYZ, or OXZ plane. If Axis prefix option in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-style:italic;"><i>System &gt; Preferences &gt; Display &gt; Dimensioning</i></span> <span lang="EN-GB">dialog is enabled then XY, YZ, or ZX appear in front of the value.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>3D</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">- select this option to make the dimension 3D.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB">See <a href="dimensioning.htm#Dimension_types">Dimensioning</a> for details about dimension types.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Alignment in view group:</b></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">Default <span style="font-weight:normal;">- select this option to make the dimension parallel</span> <span class="Command"><b style="font-weight:normal;">&#160;to the line connecting the two picked points or to the axes of the co-ordinate system - depending on the dimension type</b></span><span style="font-weight:normal;">.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">Always horizontal <span style="font-weight:normal;">- select this option to make the dimension line horizontal regardless of its type. It will stay horizontal after rotating the viewport.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:bold;">Always vertical <span style="font-weight:normal;">- select this option to make the dimension line vertical regardless of its type. It will stay vertical after rotating the viewport.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterstitle">Colouring group:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Auto</b></span> - sets auto colour selection for the current dimension. It is white if the background is dark and black if the background is light.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Custom</b></span> - check this option to display the dimension in user-defined colour. Press on the square next to the option to select the colour.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>General</b></span> button - press this button to call <span style="font-style:italic;"><i><a href="Preferences_-_Display_-_Dimensions.htm">Preferences &gt; Display &gt; Dimensions</a></i></span> dialog, from where the settings can be changed globally, i.e. for all dimensions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
